#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(2884)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,StoreTerminalCaption"
msgid "[계산대 단말기 누르는 소리]"
msgstr "[按收銀機的聲音]"

#. Key:	NarinReceiptFound
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(2887)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(2887)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,NarinReceiptFound"
msgid "작년 8월 2일이네요. 관리실 아저씨가 대신 받아 가셨어요. 뽑아 드릴게요."
msgstr "去年8月2號。是管理室那個阿伯代領的。我印一張給妳。"

#. Key:	StorePrinterCaption
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(2897)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(2897)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,StorePrinterCaption"
msgid "[영수증이 뽑혀 나오는 소리]"
msgstr "[收據印出來的聲音]"

#. Key:	YudamNarinMilkThought
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(2919)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(2919)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,YudamNarinMilkThought"
msgid "하나는 나 주던 거네. 올 때마다 들고 왔는데."
msgstr "原來其中一瓶是給我的。他每次來看我都會帶。"

#. Key:	ArrivalContractPrintedRead
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(2970)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(2970)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,ArrivalContractPrintedRead"
msgid "지상 4층. 옥상은 같이 쓰되, 창고랑 기계실은 들어가지 말라고 돼 있네."
msgstr "地上四層。頂樓是共用的，但倉庫跟機房不能進去。"

#. Key:	ArrivalToolBoxMemory
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(2985)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(2985)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,ArrivalToolBoxMemory"
msgid "이거 들 때마다 오빠가 밑에 받치라고 했는데. 손잡이 끊어진다고."
msgstr "每次搬這個，哥都叫我從底下托著。說提把會斷掉。"

#. Key:	Arrival402VacantThought
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(3006)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(3006)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,Arrival402VacantThought"
msgid "빈집이라더니. 메모만 붙어 있네."
msgstr "不是說沒人住嗎？只有紙條還貼著。"

#. Key:	ArrivalRoofClinkCaption
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(3079)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(3079)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,ArrivalRoofClinkCaption"
msgid "쇠붙이 내려놓는 소리"
msgstr "放下金屬物品的聲音"

#. Key:	ArrivalRoofRationalize
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(3100)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(3100)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,ArrivalRoofRationalize"
msgid "창고에서 짐 정리하나 보네."
msgstr "大概是在倉庫整理東西吧。"

#. Key:	UsedListingMemoThought
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(3257)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(3257)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,UsedListingMemoThought"
msgid "관리실 책상 메모에 있던 그 거래네. 8월 12일, 3만 원."
msgstr "是管理室桌上便條寫的那筆交易。8月12日，3萬韓元。"

#. Key:	UsedListingThought
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(3261)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(3261)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,UsedListingThought"
msgid "오빠 공구랑 똑같다. 판 사람이… ‘달빛’?"
msgstr "跟哥的工具一模一樣。賣家是……「月光」？"

#. Key:	RearDoorCaption
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(3286)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(3286)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,RearDoorCaption"
msgid "철문 닫히는 소리"
msgstr "鐵門關上的聲音"

#. Key:	StoreReceiptThought
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(3306)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(3306)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,StoreReceiptThought"
msgid "오빠가 부탁했다고?"
msgstr "我哥拜託他的？"

#. Key:	NarinDeliveryAnswer
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(3332)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(3332)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,NarinDeliveryAnswer"
msgid "작년 여름에 몇 번 맡겼어요. 마지막 건 건물주 아저씨가 찾아가셨고요. 오빠분이 부탁했다고 하던데요."
msgstr "去年夏天寄放過幾次。最後那件是房東阿伯來領走的，他說是妳哥拜託他的。"

#. Key:	NarinReceiptAnswer
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(3337)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(3337)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,NarinReceiptAnswer"
msgid "포스에 남아 있을 거예요. 잠깐만요, 찾아볼게요."
msgstr "收銀系統裡應該還有。等一下，我查查看。"

#. Key:	NarinLineLastDayReceipt
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(3348)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(3348)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,NarinLineLastDayReceipt"
msgid "그 영수증 잘 챙겨 둬요. 필요하면 저도 본 대로 말할게요. 무슨 일 있으면 바로 이쪽으로 오세요."
msgstr "那張收據收好喔。需要的話，我也會照實說。有什麼事就直接過來找我。"

#. Key:	NarinLineLastDay
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(3353)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(3353)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,NarinLineLastDay"
msgid "아직은요. 저 오늘도 밤새 있으니까, 무슨 일 있으면 바로 이쪽으로 오세요."
msgstr "還沒有。我今天也整晚都在，有什麼事就直接過來找我。"

#. Key:	NarinLineRoof
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(3362)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(3362)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,NarinLineRoof"
msgid "옥상요? 작년 여름에 건물주 아저씨가 자물쇠를 싹 바꿨대요. 열쇠는 관리실에나 있을걸요."
msgstr "頂樓喔？聽說去年夏天房東阿伯把鎖全換了。鑰匙大概只有管理室有吧。"

#. Key:	NarinLineMilk
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(3369)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(3369)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,NarinLineMilk"
msgid "아직 소식 없으세요? 아, 오빠분 올 때마다 바나나우유를 두 개씩 사 가셨어요. 하나는 꼭 가방 앞주머니에 넣고요."
msgstr "還是沒有消息嗎？啊，妳哥每次來都會買兩瓶香蕉牛奶，其中一瓶一定會放進包包前面的口袋。"

#. Key:	NarinLineMidWeek
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(3376)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(3376)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,NarinLineMidWeek"
msgid "아직 소식 없으세요? 저도 단골들한테 물어봤는데, 최근에 봤다는 사람은 없더라고요."
msgstr "還沒有消息嗎？我也問過常客了，都說最近沒看到他。"

#. Key:	NarinRepeatAnswer
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(3383)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(3383)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,NarinRepeatAnswer"
msgid "지금은 그 정도예요. 다른 손님들한테도 한번 물어볼게요."
msgstr "目前就知道這些。我再幫妳問問其他客人。"

#. Key:	ArrivalNarinLine
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(3388)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(3388)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,ArrivalNarinLine"
msgid "큰 가방 메고 다니시던 분이죠? 작년 여름부터 못 봤어요. 근데 403호에 오셨구나. 1년 새 세 번째예요, 그 집. 옆집은 봄부터 비어 있고요."
msgstr "是常背著大包包的那位吧？去年夏天之後就沒看過了。妳住403喔？那間一年內都換第三個房客了，隔壁從春天就一直空著。"

#. Key:	ArrivalObjectiveExplore
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(3426)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(3426)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,ArrivalObjectiveExplore"
msgid "짐 풀고 빌라와 편의점 둘러보기"
msgstr "整理行李，到公寓和便利商店四處看看"

#. Key:	ArrivalObjectiveContract
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(3430)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(3430)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,ArrivalObjectiveContract"
msgid "책상 위 임대차계약서 보기"
msgstr "看桌上的租賃契約"

#. Key:	ArrivalObjectiveBoxes
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(3434)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(3434)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,ArrivalObjectiveBoxes"
msgid "오빠가 남긴 짐 살펴보기"
msgstr "查看哥哥留下的東西"

#. Key:	ArrivalObjectiveStore
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(3438)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(3438)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,ArrivalObjectiveStore"
msgid "편의점 직원에게 오빠 소식 묻기"
msgstr "向便利商店店員打聽哥哥的消息"

#. Key:	ArrivalObjectiveNeighbors
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(3443)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(3443)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,ArrivalObjectiveNeighbors"
msgid "401호, 402호 앞 살펴보기"
msgstr "看看401室、402室門口"

#. Key:	ArrivalObjectiveRoof
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(3447)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(3447)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,ArrivalObjectiveRoof"
msgid "계약서에 적힌 옥상 문 확인하기"
msgstr "確認契約裡提到的頂樓門"

#. Key:	ArrivalObjectiveSleep
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(3449)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(3449)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,ArrivalObjectiveSleep"
msgid "403호로 돌아가서 자기"
msgstr "回403室睡覺"

#. Key:	BaselineStairsCaption
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(3656)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(3656)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,BaselineStairsCaption"
msgid "계단을 내려가는 발소리"
msgstr "下樓梯的腳步聲"

#. Key:	BaselinePipeCaption
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(3684)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(3684)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,BaselinePipeCaption"
msgid "벽 속 배관으로 물 내려가는 소리"
msgstr "牆內水管的流水聲"

#. Key:	BaselineDoorCaption
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(3738)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(3738)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,BaselineDoorCaption"
msgid "현관문 닫히는 소리"
msgstr "大門關上的聲音"

#. Key:	NightOneSolvedThought
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(3961)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(3961)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,NightOneSolvedThought"
msgid "…위에 뭐가 있어."
msgstr "……上面有東西。"

#. Key:	NightOneAboveThought
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(4068)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(4068)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,NightOneAboveThought"
msgid "형광등 우는 소리야. 이 위에 불 켜진 데가 있어."
msgstr "是日光燈嗡嗡響的聲音。這上面有個開著燈的地方。"

#. Key:	NightOneAboveKnockCaption
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(4095)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(4095)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,NightOneAboveKnockCaption"
msgid "천장에서 한 번 두드리는 소리"
msgstr "天花板傳來一下敲擊聲"

#. Key:	NightRestPrompt
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(4114)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(4114)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,NightRestPrompt"
msgid "아침까지 쉬기"
msgstr "休息到天亮"

#. Key:	NightRestBlocked
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(4139)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(4139)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,NightRestBlocked"
msgid "아직 밖에 뭐가 있어. 지금은 못 누워."
msgstr "外面還有東西。現在不能躺。"

#. Key:	ReportSentSpeaker
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(4423)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(4423)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,ReportSentSpeaker"
msgid "보낸 문자"
msgstr "已傳送的簡訊"

#. Key:	EvictionPhotoSent
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(4424)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(4424)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EvictionPhotoSent"
msgid "[사진] 관리인이 문에 붙인 종이입니다. 내일 오전 7시에 옥상 누수 공사를 한답니다. 그 전에 5층 벽을 꼭 확인해 주세요."
msgstr "［照片］這是管理員貼在門上的通知。上面說明天早上7點要做頂樓抓漏。在那之前請務必確認五樓的牆。"

#. Key:	EvictionDeadlineThought
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(4438)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(4438)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EvictionDeadlineThought"
msgid "일곱 시에 벽을 덮으면… 그 전에 와 줄 수 있을까."
msgstr "七點就要把牆封上了……他們來得及嗎？"

#. Key:	FirstReportSignalThought
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(4461)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(4461)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,FirstReportSignalThought"
msgid "신호 잡힌다. 112에 문자부터 보내자."
msgstr "有訊號了。先傳簡訊給112。"

#. Key:	FirstReportSentCover
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(4471)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(4471)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,FirstReportSentCover"
msgid "무영로 27-3 달빛빌라입니다. 옥상에 방이 하나 있어요. 작년 7월에 실종된 오빠 백도하가 살던 곳인데, 벽 안에서 두드리는 소리가 나요. 사람일 수도 있어요. 벽 옆 배관 점검구도 누가 덮개를 떼어 가고 막아 놨어요. 그 덮개는 제가 갖고 있어요. 와 주세요."
msgstr "這裡是無影路27-3號月光公寓。頂樓有個房間，是我哥白道夏去年7月失蹤前住的地方。牆裡面傳來敲擊聲，可能是人。牆邊的水管檢修口也被人拆走蓋板，封了起來。那塊蓋板在我這裡。請派人過來。"

#. Key:	FirstReportSent
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(4475)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(4475)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,FirstReportSent"
msgid "무영로 27-3 달빛빌라입니다. 옥상에 방이 하나 있어요. 작년 7월에 실종된 오빠 백도하가 살던 곳인데, 벽 안에서 두드리는 소리가 나요. 사람일 수도 있어요. 와 주세요."
msgstr "這裡是無影路27-3號月光公寓。頂樓有個房間，是我哥白道夏去年7月失蹤前住的地方。牆裡面傳來敲擊聲，可能是人。請派人過來。"

#. Key:	ReportSpeaker
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(4494)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(4494)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,ReportSpeaker"
msgid "112"
msgstr "112"

#. Key:	FirstReportReceipt
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(4495)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(4495)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,FirstReportReceipt"
msgid "[112 문자신고] 신고가 접수됐습니다. 담당 경찰관이 확인 후 연락드리겠습니다."
msgstr "［112簡訊報案］已受理您的報案，承辦員警確認後會與您聯繫。"

#. Key:	SiteCheckSpeaker
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(4517)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(4517)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,SiteCheckSpeaker"
msgid "무영경찰서 실종수사팀"
msgstr "無影警察署失蹤偵查組"

#. Key:	FirstReportSiteCheck
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(4518)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(4518)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,FirstReportSiteCheck"
msgid "옥탑은 확인했습니다. 지금은 안에서 소리나 움직임이 없어요. 보내 주신 자료로 추가 확인 중입니다. 다시 소리가 나면 바로 연락 주시고, 벽에는 손대지 마세요."
msgstr "頂樓加蓋我們已經確認過了，目前裡面沒有聲音或動靜。您傳來的資料，我們正在進一步查證。如果再聽到聲音，請立刻聯絡我們，也請先不要動那面牆。"

#. Key:	FirstReportDispatch
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(4587)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(4587)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,FirstReportDispatch"
msgid "순찰 경찰관이 지금 그쪽으로 가고 있습니다. 옥상은 관리인분이 열어 주기로 했어요."
msgstr "巡邏員警正在趕過去。頂樓的門，管理員答應會打開。"

#. Key:	SiteCheckGoUpThought
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(4596)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(4596)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,SiteCheckGoUpThought"
msgid "옥상에 먼저 올라가 있자."
msgstr "先上頂樓等吧。"

