msgstr "401室的門開了一條縫的聲音"

#. Key:	HwangSpeaker
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(5811)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(5811)
