msgid "황순금"
msgstr "黃順今"

#. Key:	Hwang401Peek
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(5812)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(5812)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,Hwang401Peek"
msgid "새벽에 나와 있었죠? 들어가서 눈 좀 붙여요."
msgstr "妳凌晨在外面對吧？回去瞇一下。"

#. Key:	Hwang401Greeting
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(5858)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(5858)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,Hwang401Greeting"
msgid "403호 새로 온 아가씨죠? 밤엔 문 좀 살살 닫아 줘요. 여기 소리가 잘 울려서."
msgstr "是403新搬來的小姐吧？晚上關門輕一點，這裡一點聲音都聽得很清楚。"

#. Key:	Hwang401HintP5
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(5874)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(5874)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,Hwang401HintP5"
msgid "물탱크 청소할 때는 배관이 꽤 시끄러워요. 그거라도 틀어 놔 봐요. 누가 뭐라 하면 내가 얘기할게요."
msgstr "洗水塔的時候，水管聲音很大。妳就把水打開試試看。誰有意見，我去跟他說。"

#. Key:	Hwang401HintP4
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(5882)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(5882)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,Hwang401HintP4"
msgid "벽이 하도 울길래 나도 똑같이 두드려 줬어요. 그랬더니 그날 밤은 조용하더라고요."
msgstr "牆一直響個不停，我也照樣敲了回去。結果那天晚上就安靜了。"

#. Key:	Hwang401HintP3
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(5890)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(5890)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,Hwang401HintP3"
msgid "관리인 없어요? 열쇠는 늘 책상 위에 두던데. 못 들어가게 하면 나한테 말해요."
msgstr "管理員不在嗎？他鑰匙都放在桌上的。不讓妳進去的話，跟我說。"

#. Key:	Hwang401AfterT7
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(5898)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(5898)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,Hwang401AfterT7"
msgid "그날도 들었어요. 사람이 없다는데, 난 분명히 들었다니까요."
msgstr "那天我也聽到了。他們說那裡沒人，可是我真的聽到了。"

#. Key:	Hwang401HintP2
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(5909)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(5909)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,Hwang401HintP2"
msgid "몇 번을 전화했는데 맨날 배관 소리래요. 장부에 적기는 했나 좀 봐 줘요."
msgstr "我都不知道打幾次電話了，他每次都說是水管聲。妳幫我看看，他到底有沒有寫進投訴紀錄簿。"

#. Key:	Hwang401HintP1
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(5917)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(5917)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,Hwang401HintP1"
msgid "전기 나갔으면 1층 계량기함 봐요. 검침표도 거기 붙어 있어요."
msgstr "停電的話去看一樓的電錶箱。抄表紀錄也貼在那裡。"

#. Key:	Hwang401Neutral
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(5924)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(5924)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,Hwang401Neutral"
msgid "잠은 좀 잤어요? 물이라도 한 잔 마시고 가요."
msgstr "有睡一下嗎？喝杯水再走吧。"

#. Key:	Arrival401PrayerStops
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(5977)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(5977)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,Arrival401PrayerStops"
msgid "안에서 들리던 불경 소리가 멈춘다"
msgstr "裡面的誦經聲停了"

#. Key:	Hwang401JournalGiven
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(6063)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(6063)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,Hwang401JournalGiven"
msgid "문고리에 걸어 둔 거 읽어 봐요. 사람이 없다는데, 난 분명히 들었다니까요."
msgstr "我掛在門把上的東西，妳看看。他們說那裡沒人，可是我真的聽到了。"

#. Key:	Hwang401SonDay
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(6079)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(6079)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,Hwang401SonDay"
msgid "이삿짐 들어오던 날, 그날이 손 있는 날이었어요."
msgstr "妳搬來那天，是不宜搬家的日子。人家說那天有遊魂在外面走。"

#. Key:	Hwang401DontOpen
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(6086)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(6086)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,Hwang401DontOpen"
msgid "문 두드린다고 다 열어 주는 거 아니에요."
msgstr "不是誰敲門都要開的。"

#. Key:	Hwang401Drill
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(6107)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(6107)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,Hwang401Drill"
msgid "새벽에 옥상에서 드릴 소리 났죠? 403호에 새 사람 들 때마다 그 양반이 그래요. 첫날 새벽엔 꼭 올라가요."
msgstr "凌晨頂樓有電鑽聲吧？每次有新的人搬進403，那個人都這樣。第一天凌晨一定會上去。"

#. Key:	YudamHwangDrillThought
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(6122)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(6122)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,YudamHwangDrillThought"
msgid "새 사람이 들 때마다? 뭘 막으러 올라가나?"
msgstr "每次有新的人搬來？他上去是要堵什麼？"

#. Key:	Hwang401DarkWarning
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(6135)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(6135)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,Hwang401DarkWarning"
msgid "새벽에 깜깜한 데서 뭐가 보이거든 쳐다보지 말아요."
msgstr "天還沒亮的時候，在暗處要是看到什麼，不要盯著看。"

#. Key:	YudamToHwangAnswer
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(6179)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(6179)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,YudamToHwangAnswer"
