msgstr "牆裡有回應了。兩下，停一下，再一下。是我哥以前敲門的節奏。"

#. Key:	Hwang401IsItYourBrother
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(6189)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(6189)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,Hwang401IsItYourBrother"
msgid "아이고… 그 사람이 오빠였어요?"
msgstr "唉……原來那是妳哥哥啊？"

#. Key:	Hwang401Permission
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(6196)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(6196)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,Hwang401Permission"
msgid "꺼내 줘요. 거기 혼자 두지 말고."
msgstr "把他帶出來吧。別讓他一個人留在那裡。"

#. Key:	NightFourWallNeedsCover
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(6253)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(6253)
