msgstr "鑰匙被他拿走了。大概又放回管理室了。"

#. Key:	YudamMokBroughtHome
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGManagerPatrol.cpp(1167)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGManagerPatrol.cpp(1167)
