#. Key:	EpilogueWorkshop1
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(837)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(837)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EpilogueWorkshop1"
msgid "오빠가 쓰던 작업표가 아직 여기 있네."
msgstr "哥的工單還留在這裡。"

#. Key:	EpilogueWorkshop2
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(841)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(841)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EpilogueWorkshop2"
msgid "업라이트 1대  ·  받는 분 백유담  ·  집들이 전에 전달"
msgstr "直立式鋼琴1台  ·  收件人 白侑潭  ·  入厝聚餐前送達"

#. Key:	EpilogueWorkshop3
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(846)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(846)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EpilogueWorkshop3"
msgid "튜닝 해머를 쥐어 본다. 손잡이 한쪽이 닳아 있다."
msgstr "握了握調音扳手。手柄有一側已經磨損了。"

#. Key:	EpilogueAutumn1
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(857)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(857)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EpilogueAutumn1"
msgid "5층을 뜯어내고 있다. 크레인이 하루 종일 골목을 막고 서 있다."
msgstr "五樓正在拆除。吊車整天堵在巷子裡。"

#. Key:	EpilogueAutumn1Vacancy
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(866)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(866)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EpilogueAutumn1Vacancy"
msgid "402호에 불이 켜져 있다. 냉장고 소리가 복도까지 들린다."
msgstr "402室亮著燈。冰箱的聲音傳到了走廊上。"

#. Key:	EpilogueAutumn2Seen
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(875)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(875)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EpilogueAutumn2Seen"
msgid "물그릇이 있던 401호 앞을 지난다. 창턱에 작은 라디오가 놓여 있다."
msgstr "經過以前放著水碗的401室門口。窗台上擺著一台小收音機。"

#. Key:	EpilogueAutumn2
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(882)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(882)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EpilogueAutumn2"
msgid "401호 창턱에 작은 라디오가 창밖을 향해 놓여 있다."
msgstr "401室的窗台上，一台小收音機朝著窗外擺著。"

#. Key:	EpilogueAutumn3Radio
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(892)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(892)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EpilogueAutumn3Radio"
msgid "문 너머로 듣던 그 불경 소리다. 창밖으로 들리게 틀어 놓으셨네."
msgstr "是以前隔著門聽到的那個誦經聲。阿嬤把它開著，讓窗外也聽得到。"

#. Key:	EpilogueAutumn3Seen
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(899)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(899)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EpilogueAutumn3Seen"
msgid "라디오를 창밖 쪽으로 돌려놓으셨다. 골목까지 들리겠다."
msgstr "阿嬤把收音機轉向窗外了。巷子裡應該也聽得到。"

#. Key:	EpilogueAutumnMilk
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(907)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(907)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EpilogueAutumnMilk"
msgid "편의점에서 바나나우유를 두 개 산다. 하나는 가방 앞주머니에 넣는다."
msgstr "在便利商店買兩瓶香蕉牛奶，一瓶放進包包前面的口袋。"

#. Key:	EpilogueAutumnJeongwooGuest
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(917)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(917)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EpilogueAutumnJeongwooGuest"
msgid "정우 씨가 헬멧을 벗고 인사한다. 요즘은 새벽에 문 두드리는 사람이 없대."
msgstr "正宇摘下安全帽跟我打招呼。他說最近凌晨沒人再敲門了。"

#. Key:	EpilogueAutumnJeongwoo
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(921)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(921)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EpilogueAutumnJeongwoo"
msgid "공동현관 앞에서 정우 씨가 헬멧을 벗고 꾸벅 인사한다."
msgstr "在公寓大門口，正宇摘下安全帽，向我點頭打招呼。"

#. Key:	EpilogueServiceBay1
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(933)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(933)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EpilogueServiceBay1"
msgid "방수포도 카트도 치워졌다. 콘크리트에 자국만 남았다."
msgstr "防水布和推車都清走了。水泥地上只剩下痕跡。"

#. Key:	EpilogueServiceBay1b
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(938)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(938)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EpilogueServiceBay1b"
msgid "관리실 창은 그날 밤 뒤로 불이 한 번도 안 켜졌다."
msgstr "那晚之後，管理室的窗戶再也沒亮過燈。"

#. Key:	EpilogueServiceBay2
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(944)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(944)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EpilogueServiceBay2"
msgid "오빠를 벽에서 꺼낸 뒤에도 할머니와 새벽에 두 번 올라왔다. 둘이서 빈 벽을 두드렸다."
msgstr "哥被從牆裡抬出來後，我和阿嬤又在天亮前上來過兩次，一起敲了那面空牆。"

#. Key:	EpilogueServiceBay3Seen
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(951)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(951)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EpilogueServiceBay3Seen"
msgid "옥상 탱크 옆, 오빠가 쉬던 자리는 아직 그대로다."
msgstr "頂樓水塔旁邊，哥以前休息的地方還是老樣子。"

#. Key:	EpilogueServiceBayJeongwooGuest
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(961)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(961)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EpilogueServiceBayJeongwooGuest"
msgid "짐은 정우 씨가 오토바이로 날라 줬다. 요즘은 새벽에 문 두드리는 사람이 없대."
msgstr "行李是正宇騎機車幫我載的。他說最近凌晨沒人再敲門了。"

#. Key:	EpilogueServiceBayJeongwoo
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(965)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(965)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EpilogueServiceBayJeongwoo"
msgid "짐은 정우 씨가 오토바이로 날라 줬다."
msgstr "行李是正宇騎機車幫我載的。"

#. Key:	EpilogueServiceBayDohaBox
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(972)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(972)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EpilogueServiceBayDohaBox"
msgid "302호에서 같이 꺼낸 오빠 상자는 정우 씨가 제일 먼저 들고 나갔다."
msgstr "我們在302室一起拉出來的那箱哥的東西，正宇最先搬了出去。"

#. Key:	EpilogueServiceBayJeongwooDoor
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(976)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(976)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EpilogueServiceBayJeongwooDoor"
msgid "“먼저 나가세요. 문은 제가 닫을게요.”"
msgstr "「妳先出去，門我來關。」"

#. Key:	EpilogueServiceBay4
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(982)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(982)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EpilogueServiceBay4"
msgid "방을 빼고 403호 열쇠를 돌려줬다."
msgstr "退了租，把403室的鑰匙還回去了。"

#. Key:	EpilogueServiceBayMilk
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(989)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(989)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EpilogueServiceBayMilk"
msgid "나오는 길에 바나나우유를 두 개 샀다. 하나는 가방 앞주머니에 넣었다."
msgstr "出來的路上買了兩瓶香蕉牛奶，一瓶放進了包包前面的口袋。"

#. Key:	FifthDawnCaptionStart
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorFifthDawnDirector.cpp(314)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorFifthDawnDirector.cpp(314)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,FifthDawnCaptionStart"
msgid "[7월 27일 · 가까이] 얕은 숨소리  ·  [오른쪽] 물 흐르는 소리"
msgstr "［7月27日 · 近處］淺淺的呼吸聲  ·  ［右側］流水聲"

#. Key:	FifthDawnCaptionWaterShift
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorFifthDawnDirector.cpp(372)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorFifthDawnDirector.cpp(372)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,FifthDawnCaptionWaterShift"
msgid "[머리 위] 배관 크게 덜컹거리는 소리"
msgstr "［頭頂］水管發出很大的碰撞聲"

#. Key:	FifthDawnCaptionSecondDawn
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorFifthDawnDirector.cpp(390)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorFifthDawnDirector.cpp(390)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,FifthDawnCaptionSecondDawn"
msgid "[7월 28일] 발소리와 불경 소리가 점점 멀어진다"
msgstr "［7月28日］腳步聲和誦經聲漸漸遠去"

#. Key:	FifthDawnCaptionThirdDawn
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorFifthDawnDirector.cpp(458)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorFifthDawnDirector.cpp(458)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,FifthDawnCaptionThirdDawn"
msgid "[7월 29일] 벽을 긁는 소리"
msgstr "［7月29日］刮牆壁的聲音"

#. Key:	FifthDawnCaptionDohaCall
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorFifthDawnDirector.cpp(510)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorFifthDawnDirector.cpp(510)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,FifthDawnCaptionDohaCall"
msgid "[벽 안] 둘, 쉬고, 하나"
msgstr "［牆內］兩下，停一下，再一下"

#. Key:	FifthDawnCaptionHwangReply
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorFifthDawnDirector.cpp(529)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorFifthDawnDirector.cpp(529)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,FifthDawnCaptionHwangReply"
msgid "[아주 멀리] 같은 박자로 대답하는 소리"
msgstr "［很遠處］用同樣節奏回應的聲音"

#. Key:	FifthDawnCaptionFourthDawn
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorFifthDawnDirector.cpp(549)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorFifthDawnDirector.cpp(549)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,FifthDawnCaptionFourthDawn"
msgid "[7월 30일] 느리고 약한 숨소리"
msgstr "［7月30日］緩慢微弱的呼吸聲"

#. Key:	FifthDawnCaptionFinalDawn
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorFifthDawnDirector.cpp(562)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorFifthDawnDirector.cpp(562)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,FifthDawnCaptionFinalDawn"
msgid "[7월 31일] 다섯 번째 새벽"
msgstr "［7月31日］第五天凌晨"

#. Key:	FifthDawnCaptionNoReply
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorFifthDawnDirector.cpp(579)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorFifthDawnDirector.cpp(579)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,FifthDawnCaptionNoReply"
msgid "[벽 안] 두드리다 멈추는 소리  ·  대답 없음"
msgstr "［牆內］敲到一半停下的聲音  ·  沒有回應"

#. Key:	FifthDawnCaptionBreathOnly
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorFifthDawnDirector.cpp(596)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorFifthDawnDirector.cpp(596)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,FifthDawnCaptionBreathOnly"
msgid "[가까이] 희미한 숨소리"
msgstr "［近處］微弱的呼吸聲"

#. Key:	LeftoverFrameCatchCaption
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverAnnex.cpp(209)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverAnnex.cpp(209)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,LeftoverFrameCatchCaption"
msgid "[철골 마디가 틀에 걸려 끼는 소리]"
msgstr "［鋼骨的關節卡進鋼架的聲音］"

#. Key:	LeftoverPushedCaption
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverAnnex.cpp(237)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverAnnex.cpp(237)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,LeftoverPushedCaption"
msgid "[휜 철골이 빠지고, 벽을 긁으며 물러나는 소리]"
msgstr "[彎掉的鋼架鬆脫，刮著牆往後退的聲音]"

#. Key:	LeftoverPieceAPrompt
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverDirector.cpp(1003)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverDirector.cpp(1003)
