msgid "막에 붙은 조각 떼어 내기"
msgstr "撕下黏在膜上的碎片"

#. Key:	LeftoverPieceBPrompt
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverDirector.cpp(1011)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverDirector.cpp(1011)
