msgid "301  (공실)   선반·전기장판            24.12.20"
msgstr "301  (空屋)   層架、電熱毯             24.12.20"

#. Key:	LeftoverLedger3
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverDirector.cpp(1052)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverDirector.cpp(1052)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,LeftoverLedger3"
msgid "옥탑 백도하   공구·상자 2              24.7.26"
msgstr "頂樓 白道夏   工具、箱子 2             24.7.26"

#. Key:	LeftoverLedger4
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverDirector.cpp(1054)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverDirector.cpp(1054)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,LeftoverLedger4"
msgid "위 짐 일체 주인 없음. 수거일에 같이 처리."
msgstr "以上物品皆無主。清運日一併處理。"

#. Key:	LeftoverCotPrompt
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverDirector.cpp(1060)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverDirector.cpp(1060)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,LeftoverCotPrompt"
msgid "간이침대 보기"
msgstr "看行軍床"

#. Key:	LeftoverCotThought
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverDirector.cpp(1062)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverDirector.cpp(1062)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,LeftoverCotThought"
msgid "여기서 먹고 자나 봐. 베개 밑에 귀마개가 있어."
msgstr "他好像吃住都在這裡。枕頭底下有耳塞。"

#. Key:	LeftoverBoardsPrompt
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverDirector.cpp(1066)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverDirector.cpp(1066)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,LeftoverBoardsPrompt"
msgid "떼어 낸 판재 보기"
msgstr "看拆下來的板材"

#. Key:	LeftoverBoardsThought
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverDirector.cpp(1068)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverDirector.cpp(1068)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,LeftoverBoardsThought"
msgid "벽에서 뜯어낸 판이야. 뒷면마다 방수 시트가 붙어 있어."
msgstr "是從牆上拆下來的板子。每塊背面都貼著防水膜。"

#. Key:	LeftoverHeapPrompt
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverDirector.cpp(1072)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverDirector.cpp(1072)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,LeftoverHeapPrompt"
msgid "벽에 붙은 더미 보기"
msgstr "看貼在牆上的那一堆"

#. Key:	LeftoverHeapThought
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverDirector.cpp(1074)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverDirector.cpp(1074)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,LeftoverHeapThought"
msgid "방음재랑 방수 시트를 겹겹이 덧대 놨어. 철 골조까지 같이 붙어 있네."
msgstr "隔音棉和防水膜一層一層補上去了。連鋼骨都一起黏在上面。"

#. Key:	LeftoverLedgerThought
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverDirector.cpp(1107)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverDirector.cpp(1107)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,LeftoverLedgerThought"
msgid "오빠 이름까지 적어 놓고 주인이 없대."
msgstr "連我哥的名字都寫了，還說是沒人認領的東西。"

#. Key:	LeftoverInnerLockedPrompt
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverDirector.cpp(1123)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverDirector.cpp(1123)
