msgid "이것도 방수막째 잘린 조각이야."
msgstr "這塊也是連防水膜一起切下來的。"

#. Key:	LeftoverGloveBoxThought
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverDirector.cpp(1269)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverDirector.cpp(1269)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,LeftoverGloveBoxThought"
msgid "202호 정우 씨 짐이네. 주인 없음 딱지가 붙어 있어."
msgstr "是202室正宇的東西。貼紙上寫著無主。"

#. Key:	LeftoverGlovesThought
