msgstr "他往停車場那邊出去了。裡間的門開著。"

#. Key:	LeftoverErrandBack
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverDirector.cpp(1360)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverDirector.cpp(1360)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,LeftoverErrandBack"
msgid "손수레 소리가 이쪽으로 와. 나가야 해."
msgstr "手推車的聲音往這邊來了。得出去了。"

#. Key:	N2ReturnThought
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverDirector.cpp(1429)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverDirector.cpp(1429)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,N2ReturnThought"
msgid "이제 403호까지 올라가야 해."
msgstr "現在得上樓回403室。"

#. Key:	LeftoverNoticePrompt
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverDirector.cpp(1477)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverDirector.cpp(1477)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,LeftoverNoticePrompt"
msgid "수거 안내 읽기"
msgstr "看清運通知"

#. Key:	LeftoverNoticeTitle
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverDirector.cpp(1479)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverDirector.cpp(1479)
