msgstr "大型廢棄物清運通知"

#. Key:	LeftoverNotice1
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverDirector.cpp(1481)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverDirector.cpp(1481)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,LeftoverNotice1"
msgid "건물 안에 주인 없이 남은 짐을 한꺼번에 처리합니다."
msgstr "大樓內無主的遺留物品將統一清運。"

#. Key:	LeftoverNotice2
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverDirector.cpp(1483)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverDirector.cpp(1483)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,LeftoverNotice2"
msgid "수거일: 다음 주 월요일 오전 [두 줄 그어 지움]"
msgstr "清運日：下週一上午［用兩條線劃掉］"

#. Key:	LeftoverNotice3
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverDirector.cpp(1484)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverDirector.cpp(1484)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,LeftoverNotice3"
msgid "이번 주 목요일 아침 7시 [볼펜 손글씨]"
msgstr "本週四早上7點［原子筆手寫］"

#. Key:	LeftoverNotice4
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverDirector.cpp(1486)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverDirector.cpp(1486)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,LeftoverNotice4"
msgid "버릴 짐은 전날 밤까지 필로티 적치 자리에 내놓아 주세요."
msgstr "要丟棄的物品，請於前一晚放到一樓停車場的堆放處。"

#. Key:	LeftoverNotice5
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverDirector.cpp(1487)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverDirector.cpp(1487)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,LeftoverNotice5"
msgid "찾아갈 짐이 있으면 관리실에 말씀해 주세요.  -관리인"
msgstr "如有要領回的物品，請告知管理室。  -管理員"

#. Key:	LeftoverHoldDoorPrompt
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverDirector.cpp(1506)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverDirector.cpp(1506)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,LeftoverHoldDoorPrompt"
msgid "문 잡아 주기"
msgstr "幫忙拉住門"

