#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverDirector.cpp(1523)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverDirector.cpp(1523)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,LeftoverNoticeThought"
