#. Key:	LeftoverUnknownSender
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverDirector.cpp(1569)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverDirector.cpp(1569)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,LeftoverUnknownSender"
msgid "202호"
msgstr "202室"

#. Key:	LeftoverJeongwooAlone
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverDirector.cpp(1571)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverDirector.cpp(1571)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,LeftoverJeongwooAlone"
msgid "새벽에 판이 갑자기 헐거워져서 겨우 밀고 나왔어요. 상자는 못 챙겼어요. 302호 혼자 가지 마세요."
