msgstr "［巷子盡頭的卡車引擎聲漸漸遠去］"

#. Key:	LeftoverEmptiedThought
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverDirector.cpp(1599)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverDirector.cpp(1599)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,LeftoverEmptiedThought"
