msgstr "全都載走了。只剩下繩子和撕破的貼紙。"

#. Key:	LeftoverBoxesIntro
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverDirector.cpp(1678)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverDirector.cpp(1678)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,LeftoverBoxesIntro"
msgid "어, 어제 골목에서 뵌… 진짜 죄송했어요. 저 202호 정우예요."
msgstr "啊，妳是昨天在巷子裡遇到的……真的很抱歉。我是202的正宇。"

#. Key:	LeftoverBoxesAskDoor
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverDirector.cpp(1682)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverDirector.cpp(1682)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,LeftoverBoxesAskDoor"
