msgstr "那個，不好意思，可以幫我拉一下門嗎？"

#. Key:	LeftoverBoxesWhy
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverDirector.cpp(1694)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverDirector.cpp(1694)
