msgstr "［固定夾喀一聲扣上的聲音］"

#. Key:	LeftoverAssembledThought
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(1453)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(1453)
