msgstr "污漬斜斜地連成一線。是水從上面滲下來的痕跡。"

#. Key:	LeftoverVentThought
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(1482)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(1482)
