msgstr "拿隔音棉把通風口硬塞住，上面再蓋上防水膜。"

#. Key:	LeftoverUnknownVoice
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(151)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(151)
