msgid "이만한 덧판을 어디서 봤는데."
msgstr "這麼大的補板，我在哪裡看過。"

#. Key:	LeftoverCoverTakeUnseen
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(1572)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(1572)
