msgid "네 귀퉁이에 나사 구멍이 있어. 어딘가에 박혀 있던 거야."
msgstr "四個角都有螺絲孔。本來是鎖在某個地方的。"

#. Key:	LeftoverSiteMatch1
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(1588)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(1588)
