msgid "판 세워 받치기"
msgstr "把板子扶起來撐住"

#. Key:	LeftoverSackPrompt
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(243)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(243)
