msgid "마대 열어 보기"
msgstr "打開麻布袋看看"

#. Key:	LeftoverDohaPullPrompt
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(247)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(247)
