msgid "상자 이름표 보기"
msgstr "看箱子上的標籤"

#. Key:	LeftoverJeongwooText
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(523)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(523)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,LeftoverJeongwooText"
msgid "[04:12] 302호 짐 빼러 들어왔는데 상자가 판에 끼어서 안 빠지네요. 조금만 더 해 보고 갈게요."
msgstr "［04:12］我進302搬東西，箱子被板子卡住拉不出來。我再試一下就走。"

#. Key:	LeftoverBoardKnockCaption
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(542)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(542)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,LeftoverBoardKnockCaption"
msgid "[302호 안에서 판을 두드리는 소리]"
msgstr "［302室裡傳來敲板子的聲音］"

#. Key:	LeftoverTrappedCall
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(543)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(543)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,LeftoverTrappedCall"
msgid "거기 누구 있어요? 판이 넘어와서 못 나가겠어요."
msgstr "有人在嗎？板子倒過來，我出不去了。"

#. Key:	LeftoverDohaNameThought
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(569)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(569)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,LeftoverDohaNameThought"
msgid "백도하. 오빠 글씨야."
msgstr "白道夏。是哥的字。"

#. Key:	LeftoverKeepBox
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(572)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(572)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,LeftoverKeepBox"
msgid "잠깐만요. 이 상자는 두세요. 오빠 이름이 있어요."
msgstr "等一下。這箱先留著。上面有我哥的名字。"

#. Key:	LeftoverMarkBox
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(573)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(573)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,LeftoverMarkBox"
msgid "그럼 이건 따로 빼 둘게요. 버리지 말라고 표시해 놓을게요."
msgstr "那這箱我另外放。我會做個記號，寫明不要丟。"

#. Key:	LeftoverTrappedFallen
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(587)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(587)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,LeftoverTrappedFallen"
msgid "판이 더 내려왔어요. 밑에 받칠 거 없어요?"
msgstr "板子又倒下來一些了。有沒有東西可以墊在底下？"

#. Key:	LeftoverTrappedTalk
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(588)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(588)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,LeftoverTrappedTalk"
msgid "상자 빼다가 판이 넘어왔어요. 벽에 붙은 저게 판을 밀고 있어요."
msgstr "我搬箱子的時候板子倒過來了。貼在牆上的那東西在推板子。"

#. Key:	LeftoverWedgePicked
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(596)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(596)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,LeftoverWedgePicked"
msgid "문 고이는 나무 쐐기야."
msgstr "是擋門用的木楔。"

#. Key:	LeftoverLabel303Thought
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(626)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(626)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,LeftoverLabel303Thought"
msgid "딱지 밑에 303호가 써 붙인 게 있어. 겨울까지만 맡긴다고."
msgstr "貼紙底下有303室寫好貼上的紙條。說只放到冬天。"

#. Key:	LeftoverSackThought
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(642)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(642)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,LeftoverSackThought"
msgid "남은 조각 하나랑 금속 틀이야. 관리실에서 떼어 온 거랑 같은 막이 붙어 있어."
msgstr "最後一塊碎片，還有金屬框。上面的膜跟管理室拿來的那幾塊一樣。"

#. Key:	LeftoverSackAllPieces
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(643)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(643)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,LeftoverSackAllPieces"
msgid "점검구 덮개 조각 셋이랑 금속 틀이야."
msgstr "三塊檢修口蓋板的碎片，還有金屬框。"

#. Key:	LeftoverWedgeHeld
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(676)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(676)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,LeftoverWedgeHeld"
msgid "물렸어. 이제 판이 안 밀려."
msgstr "卡住了。這下板子推不動了。"

#. Key:	LeftoverWedgeSlip1
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(690)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(690)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,LeftoverWedgeSlip1"
msgid "장판에서 미끄러져 빠졌어."
msgstr "在塑膠地板上滑出來了。"

#. Key:	LeftoverWedgeSlip2
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(691)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(691)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,LeftoverWedgeSlip2"
msgid "또 빠졌어. 장판 위라 걸릴 데가 없어."
msgstr "又滑出來了。塑膠地板上沒有東西卡得住。"

#. Key:	LeftoverWardrobeCaption
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(715)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(715)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,LeftoverWardrobeCaption"
msgid "[장롱 다리가 장판을 긁으며 밀리는 소리]"
msgstr "［衣櫃腳刮著地板被推開的聲音］"

#. Key:	LeftoverWardrobeHatch
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(745)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(745)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,LeftoverWardrobeHatch"
msgid "장롱 뒤에 점검구가 있었어. 저쪽 틈보다 훨씬 커."
msgstr "衣櫃後面有個檢修口。比那邊的縫大多了。"

#. Key:	LeftoverReleasedBraced
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(763)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(763)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,LeftoverReleasedBraced"
msgid "어, 판이 풀렸어요. 밀어 볼게요."
msgstr "咦，板子鬆了。我推推看。"

#. Key:	LeftoverBoardFallCaption
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(772)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(772)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,LeftoverBoardFallCaption"
msgid "[큰 판이 미끄러지며 쾅 하고 눕는 소리]"
msgstr "［大板子一滑，砰地倒下的聲音］"

#. Key:	LeftoverFallenLine
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(780)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(780)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,LeftoverFallenLine"
msgid "괜찮아요! 근데 판이 더 내려와서 못 나가겠어요."
msgstr "我沒事！可是板子又倒下來一些，我出不去了。"

#. Key:	LeftoverFallenThought
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(783)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(783)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,LeftoverFallenThought"
msgid "밑동이 쭉 미끄러졌어. 판이 더 누웠어."
msgstr "底部整個滑掉了。板子又倒得更斜了。"

#. Key:	LeftoverFreedIntro
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(810)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(810)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,LeftoverFreedIntro"
msgid "살았다… 고마워요. 저 202호 정우예요."
msgstr "得救了……謝謝妳。我是202的正宇。"

#. Key:	LeftoverFreedLine
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(814)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(814)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,LeftoverFreedLine"
msgid "살았다… 고마워요."
msgstr "得救了……謝謝妳。"

#. Key:	LeftoverFreedBoxLine
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(818)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(818)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,LeftoverFreedBoxLine"
msgid "그 상자, 표시해 둔 거요. 아직 판 밑에 걸려 있어요."
msgstr "那個箱子，就是我做了記號的那個。還卡在板子底下。"

#. Key:	LeftoverBraceAgain
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(856)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(856)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,LeftoverBraceAgain"
msgid "상자요? 잠깐만요, 판 잡을게요."
msgstr "箱子？等一下，我來撐板子。"

#. Key:	LeftoverBoxStuck
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(878)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(878)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,LeftoverBoxStuck"
msgid "잠깐만요. 상자가 걸렸어요."
msgstr "等一下，箱子卡住了。"

#. Key:	LeftoverBoxStuckReply
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(879)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(879)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,LeftoverBoxStuckReply"
msgid "모서리가 판에 걸렸어요. 조금만 더요."
msgstr "箱角卡到板子了。再一下下。"

#. Key:	LeftoverPouchThought
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(887)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(887)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,LeftoverPouchThought"
msgid "오빠 공구 주머니야. 집에 가져가자."
msgstr "是哥的工具袋。帶回家吧。"

#. Key:	LeftoverLeaveBoxLine
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(907)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(907)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,LeftoverLeaveBoxLine"
msgid "문 잡고 있을게요. 상자 뺄 거면 말해요, 판 잡아 줄게요."
msgstr "門我幫妳拉著。要拿箱子就說一聲，我幫妳撐住板子。"

#. Key:	LeftoverLeaveLine
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(908)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(908)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,LeftoverLeaveLine"
msgid "문 잡고 있을게요. 더 볼 거 있으면 보고 나와요."
msgstr "門我幫妳拉著。還有要看的，看完再出來。"

#. Key:	LeftoverBraceRelease
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(920)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(920)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,LeftoverBraceRelease"
msgid "판 놓을게요. 상자는 이따 다시 해요."
msgstr "板子我先放下囉。箱子等一下再弄。"

#. Key:	LeftoverByeLine
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(942)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(942)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,LeftoverByeLine"
msgid "짐은 낮에 마저 뺄게요. 들어가세요."
msgstr "剩下的東西我白天再來搬。妳先回去吧。"

