#. Key:	NightThreeStorage3Wardrobe
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(101)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(101)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightThreeStorage3Wardrobe"
msgid "장롱을 밀면 뒤에 큰 점검구가 있어. 그걸 열자."
msgstr "推開衣櫃，後面有個大檢修口。把它打開。"

#. Key:	NightThreeStorage3Hatch
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(102)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(102)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightThreeStorage3Hatch"
msgid "장롱 뒤 점검구를 열자. 저게 그리로 옮겨 가면 판이 풀려."
msgstr "打開衣櫃後面的檢修口。那東西移過去，板子就會鬆開。"

#. Key:	NightThreeStorage1
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(105)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(105)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightThreeStorage1"
msgid "302호에 판이 넘어와서 정우 씨가 못 나오고 있어."
msgstr "302室的板子倒下來了，正宇出不來。"

#. Key:	NightThreeStorage2Seen
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(107)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(107)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightThreeStorage2Seen"
msgid "판은 밑동에서 밀려 나와. 관리실에선 큰 점검구를 열자 저게 그리로 옮겨 갔지."
msgstr "板子是從底部被推出來的。在管理室的時候，我一打開大的檢修口，那東西就移過去了。"

#. Key:	NightThreeStorage2
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(108)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(108)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightThreeStorage2"
msgid "판은 밑동에서 밀려 나와. 누르는 걸 다른 데로 돌릴 수는 없을까."
msgstr "板子是從底部被推出來的。能不能讓壓著它的東西轉到別的地方？"

#. Key:	ArrivalContract1
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(118)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(118)
msgctxt "IGHint,ArrivalContract1"
msgid "책상 위에 계약서를 뒀지. 한번 읽어 보자."
msgstr "契約放在桌上了。來看一下吧。"

#. Key:	ArrivalContract2
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(119)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(119)
msgctxt "IGHint,ArrivalContract2"
msgid "403호 책상 위 임대차계약서. 그것부터 보자."
msgstr "403室桌上的租賃契約。先看那個。"

#. Key:	ArrivalBoxes1
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(126)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(126)
msgctxt "IGHint,ArrivalBoxes1"
msgid "짐을 아직 다 안 풀었네."
msgstr "行李還沒整理完。"

#. Key:	ArrivalBoxes2
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(127)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(127)
msgctxt "IGHint,ArrivalBoxes2"
msgid "택배 상자, 공구 상자, 예전 휴대폰 상자. 셋 다 열어 보자."
msgstr "包裹、工具箱、舊手機的盒子。三個都打開看看。"

#. Key:	ArrivalStore1
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(132)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(132)
msgctxt "IGHint,ArrivalStore1"
msgid "편의점에 사진 한번 보여 드릴까."
msgstr "拿照片問問便利商店的店員吧。"

#. Key:	ArrivalStore2
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(133)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(133)
msgctxt "IGHint,ArrivalStore2"
msgid "편의점에 가서 물어보자. 1층에서 골목으로 나가면 돼."
msgstr "去便利商店問問吧。從一樓出去就是巷子。"

#. Key:	ArrivalNeighbors1
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(140)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(140)
msgctxt "IGHint,ArrivalNeighbors1"
msgid "옆집에는 아직 인사도 못 했네."
msgstr "都還沒跟鄰居打過招呼。"

#. Key:	ArrivalNeighborsBoth
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(142)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(142)
msgctxt "IGHint,ArrivalNeighborsBoth"
msgid "401호는 문을 두드려 보고, 402호는 문에 붙은 메모를 읽어 보자."
msgstr "去敲401室的門，再看看402室門上貼的紙條。"

#. Key:	ArrivalNeighbors401
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(144)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(144)
msgctxt "IGHint,ArrivalNeighbors401"
msgid "401호 문을 두드려 보자. 누가 사는지는 알아야지."
msgstr "去敲401室的門。至少要知道住的是誰。"

#. Key:	ArrivalNeighbors402
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(145)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(145)
msgctxt "IGHint,ArrivalNeighbors402"
msgid "402호 문에 붙은 메모를 아직 안 읽었네."
msgstr "402室門上貼的紙條還沒看。"

#. Key:	ArrivalRoof1
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(150)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(150)
msgctxt "IGHint,ArrivalRoof1"
msgid "계약서에 옥상 얘기가 있었는데."
msgstr "契約上有提到頂樓的事。"

#. Key:	ArrivalRoof2
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(151)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(151)
msgctxt "IGHint,ArrivalRoof2"
msgid "계단 끝까지 올라가서 옥상 문을 확인해 보자."
msgstr "沿著樓梯爬到最上面，看看頂樓的門。"

#. Key:	ArrivalSleep1
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(154)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(154)
msgctxt "IGHint,ArrivalSleep1"
msgid "오늘은 이만 자자."
msgstr "今天就先睡吧。"

#. Key:	ArrivalSleep2
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(155)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(155)
msgctxt "IGHint,ArrivalSleep2"
msgid "403호 침대에 눕자. 알람은 네 시 반에 맞춰 뒀어."
msgstr "到403室的床上躺下。鬧鐘設在凌晨四點半了。"

#. Key:	NightOne3Dial
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(164)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(164)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightOne3Dial"
msgid "복도등을 끄고, 이름표 없는 차단기를 내렸다 올리면서 다섯 번째 원판을 보자."
msgstr "關掉走廊燈，把沒貼標籤的斷路器扳下再扳上，同時看第五個電錶的轉盤。"

#. Key:	NightOne3Sheet
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(166)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(166)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightOne3Sheet"
msgid "검침 기록지도 읽어 봐야 해. 마지막 칸이 이상했어."
msgstr "抄表紀錄也得看一下。最後一行怪怪的。"

#. Key:	NightOne3Breaker
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(167)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(167)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightOne3Breaker"
msgid "이름표 없는 차단기를 올려 둔 채로 원판을 한 번 더 보자."
msgstr "沒貼標籤的斷路器扳上後不要動，再看一次轉盤。"

#. Key:	NightOne1
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(169)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(169)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightOne1"
msgid "위에 누가 있으면 전기를 쓰겠지. 1층 계량기함을 봐야겠다."
msgstr "樓上如果有人，就會用電吧。得去看看一樓的電錶箱。"

#. Key:	NightOne2
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(170)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(170)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightOne2"
msgid "이름 없는 계량기가 하나 더 있었지. 복도등을 꺼도 돌아가면 다른 데 전기가 들어가는 거야."
msgstr "還有個沒標籤的電錶。如果關掉走廊燈後它還在轉，表示別的地方在用電。"

#. Key:	NightTwo3Carbon
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(181)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(181)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightTwo3Carbon"
msgid "연필로 접수철 밑장을 끝까지 문질러 보자."
msgstr "用鉛筆把投訴登記單底下那張紙從頭塗到尾。"

#. Key:	NightTwo3Agent
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(183)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(183)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightTwo3Agent"
msgid "책상에 부동산 문자 출력본이 있었어. 그것도 읽어 보자."
msgstr "桌上有一份房仲簡訊的列印本。那個也看一下。"

#. Key:	NightTwo3Desk
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(184)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(184)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightTwo3Desk"
msgid "관리실 책상을 한 번 더 둘러보자."
msgstr "把管理室的桌子再看一遍。"

#. Key:	NightTwo1
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(186)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(186)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightTwo1"
msgid "소음 민원이 들어갔다면 관리실에 기록이 남았겠지."
msgstr "如果有人投訴過噪音，管理室應該會留下紀錄。"

#. Key:	NightTwo2
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(187)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(187)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightTwo2"
msgid "민원 대장이 너무 깨끗해. 접수철은 윗장이 뜯겼던데, 밑장에 눌린 자국이 남았을지도."
msgstr "投訴紀錄簿太乾淨了。登記單最上面那張被撕掉了，底下那張說不定還留著壓痕。"

#. Key:	NightTwoInner1
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(196)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(196)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightTwoInner1"
msgid "아저씨가 나간 사이에 안쪽 방을 봐야 해."
msgstr "得趁阿伯出去的時候看看裡間。"

#. Key:	NightTwoInner2
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(197)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(197)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightTwoInner2"
msgid "작업대와 벽에 붙은 조각, 보관함, 상자를 살펴보자."
msgstr "看看工作檯和牆上黏著的碎片，還有置物櫃和箱子。"

#. Key:	NightTwoInner3
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(198)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(198)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightTwoInner3"
msgid "손수레 소리가 다시 가까워지기 전에 관리실을 나가자."
msgstr "手推車的聲音再靠近之前，先離開管理室。"

#. Key:	NightTwoRevisit1
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(206)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(206)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightTwoRevisit1"
msgid "어젯밤엔 403호까지 못 돌아왔어."
msgstr "昨晚沒能回到403室。"

#. Key:	NightTwoRevisit2
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(207)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(207)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightTwoRevisit2"
msgid "1층 관리실에 다시 들렀다가 403호로 돌아오자."
msgstr "再去一趟一樓管理室，然後回403室。"

#. Key:	NightTwoReturn1
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(211)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(211)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightTwoReturn1"
msgid "이제 403호로 돌아가야 해."
msgstr "現在得回403室了。"

#. Key:	NightTwoReturn2
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(212)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(212)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightTwoReturn2"
msgid "계단으로 올라가서 403호 안까지. 발소리를 줄이자."
msgstr "走樓梯上去，一路走進403室裡。腳步放輕。"

#. Key:	NightTwoReturn3
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(213)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(213)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightTwoReturn3"
msgid "쫓아오면 뛰어서라도 403호 안으로 들어가자."
msgstr "被追的話，用跑的也要衝進403室。"

#. Key:	NightThreeReturn1
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(226)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(226)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightThreeReturn1"
msgid "이제 403호로 돌아가자."
msgstr "現在回403室吧。"

#. Key:	NightThreeReturn2
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(227)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(227)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightThreeReturn2"
msgid "아까 그 박자로 두드리니까 멈췄어. 복도에서도 통할까."
msgstr "剛才照那個節奏敲，他就停了。在走廊裡也管用嗎？"

#. Key:	NightThreeReturn3
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(228)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(228)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightThreeReturn3"
msgid "복도에서 둘, 쉬고, 하나로 두드리고, 멈춘 사이에 403호로 들어가자."
msgstr "在走廊敲兩下，停一下，再一下，趁他停住的時候進403室。"

#. Key:	NightThreeRhythm1
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(239)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(239)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightThreeRhythm1"
msgid "오빠가 문 두드리던 박자가 있었는데."
msgstr "哥以前敲門，都有固定的節奏。"

#. Key:	NightThreeRhythm2
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(240)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(240)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightThreeRhythm2"
msgid "음성 메시지에서 그랬잖아. “문 두드리면 알지? 둘, 하나.”"
msgstr "語音留言裡不是說了嗎？「聽到敲門就知道是我了吧？兩下，再一下。」"

#. Key:	NightThreeRhythm3Notebook
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(242)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(242)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightThreeRhythm3Notebook"
msgid "조율 수첩에도 그 박자가 적혀 있었을 거야. 수첩부터 다시 보자."
msgstr "調音筆記本上應該也寫了那個節奏。先把筆記本再看一遍。"

#. Key:	NightThreeRhythm3
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(243)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(243)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightThreeRhythm3"
msgid "둘, 쉬고, 하나. 그 박자로 비어 있는 벽을 두드려 보자."
msgstr "兩下，停一下，再一下。用這個節奏敲那面空心的牆。"

#. Key:	NightThreeKey1
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(251)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(251)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightThreeKey1"
msgid "옥상 문을 열 열쇠가 있어야 해."
msgstr "得有能打開頂樓門的鑰匙。"

#. Key:	NightThreeKey2
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(252)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(252)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightThreeKey2"
msgid "관리실 책상 위에 열쇠 꾸러미가 있었지."
msgstr "管理室桌上有一串鑰匙。"

#. Key:	NightThreeKey3
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(253)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(253)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightThreeKey3"
msgid "1층 관리실에서 열쇠 꾸러미를 챙겨서 옥상으로 올라가자."
msgstr "去一樓管理室拿那串鑰匙，再上頂樓。"

#. Key:	NightThreeDoor1
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(261)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(261)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightThreeDoor1"
msgid "옥상부터 둘러보자."
msgstr "先到頂樓看看。"

#. Key:	NightThreeDoor2
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(262)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(262)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightThreeDoor2"
msgid "옥상 물탱크 옆으로 가면 철문이 있어."
msgstr "往頂樓水塔旁邊走，就有一扇鐵門。"

#. Key:	NightThreeDoor3
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(263)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(263)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightThreeDoor3"
msgid "열쇠 꾸러미의 다른 열쇠로 5층 철문을 열자."
msgstr "用那串鑰匙裡的另一把，打開五樓的鐵門。"

#. Key:	NightThreeWall1
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(266)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(266)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightThreeWall1"
msgid "벽마다 소리가 다른지 들어 보자."
msgstr "聽聽這幾面牆的聲音有沒有不一樣。"

#. Key:	NightThreeWall2Criterion
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(268)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(268)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightThreeWall2Criterion"
msgid "수첩에 적혀 있었지. 빈 곳은 낮게 울리고 소리가 오래 간다고."
msgstr "筆記本上有寫。空心的地方聲音低沉，回音持續比較久。"

#. Key:	NightThreeWall2Notebook
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(269)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(269)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightThreeWall2Notebook"
msgid "조율 수첩에 벽 얘기가 있었을 거야. 그것부터 읽자."
msgstr "調音筆記本裡應該有提到牆的事。先讀那個。"

#. Key:	NightThreeWall3
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(270)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(270)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightThreeWall3"
msgid "배관 밸브를 열고 벽마다 귀를 대 보자. 아니면 하나씩 두드려서 어디가 오래 울리는지 들어 보자."
msgstr "打開水管的閥門，每面牆都貼耳聽聽看。不然就一面一面敲，聽哪裡響得比較久。"

#. Key:	NightFour3Drain
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(278)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(278)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightFour3Drain"
msgid "옥상 저수조의 세척 배수 밸브부터 열자."
msgstr "先打開頂樓水塔的排水閥。"

#. Key:	NightFour3Bypass
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(280)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(280)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightFour3Bypass"
msgid "다음은 옥상 우회 밸브야."
msgstr "接下來是頂樓的旁通閥。"

#. Key:	NightFour3Pump
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(281)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(281)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightFour3Pump"
msgid "마지막으로 1층 관리실의 이송 펌프를 수동으로 돌리자."
msgstr "最後到一樓管理室，手動啟動抽水馬達。"

#. Key:	NightFour1
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(283)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(283)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightFour1"
msgid "망치 소리가 너무 클 텐데. 좀 덜 들리게 할 수 없을까."
msgstr "鐵鎚敲下去一定很大聲。有沒有辦法蓋掉一點聲音？"

#. Key:	NightFour2
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(284)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(284)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightFour2"
msgid "탱크를 청소할 땐 배관이 시끄럽댔지. 점검 메모를 보자."
msgstr "不是說洗水塔的時候水管會很吵嗎？看一下水塔檢查筆記。"

#. Key:	NightFourWall0a
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(298)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(298)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightFourWall0a"
msgid "물소리가 나는 동안 벽을 뜯어야 해."
msgstr "得趁有水聲的時候把牆拆開。"

#. Key:	NightFourWall0b
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(299)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(299)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightFourWall0b"
msgid "가운데 칸에만 판을 한 겹 더 댔어. 고정한 데를 찾자."
msgstr "只有中間那一格多加了一層板。找出固定的地方。"

#. Key:	NightFourWall0c
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(300)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(300)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightFourWall0c"
msgid "위쪽 덧판 이음매를 망치로 치자. 테이프 밑에 나사가 있어."
msgstr "拿鐵鎚敲上面補板的接縫。膠帶底下有螺絲。"

#. Key:	NightFourWall1a
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(303)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(303)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightFourWall1a"
msgid "그게 이음매를 덮고 있어."
msgstr "那東西蓋在接縫上。"

#. Key:	NightFourWall1b
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(304)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(304)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightFourWall1b"
msgid "더 큰 틈을 내주면 그리로 옮겨 가겠지."
msgstr "給它一個更大的開口，它應該就會移過去。"

#. Key:	NightFourWall1c
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(305)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(305)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightFourWall1c"
msgid "구석 쪽 작은 덧판을 떼어서 점검구를 열자."
msgstr "拆掉角落那塊小補板，打開檢修口。"

#. Key:	NightFourWall2Ba
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(309)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(309)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightFourWall2Ba"
msgid "이제 못 접어."
msgstr "這下它折不起來了。"

#. Key:	NightFourWall2Bb
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(310)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(310)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightFourWall2Bb"
msgid "이음매 위로 나사가 드러나 있었지."
msgstr "接縫上露出了螺絲。"

#. Key:	NightFourWall2Bc
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(311)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(311)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightFourWall2Bc"
msgid "드러난 덧판 나사를 망치로 쳐 내자."
msgstr "拿鐵鎚把露出來的補板螺絲敲掉。"

#. Key:	NightFourWall2a
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(313)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(313)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightFourWall2a"
msgid "천장까지 몸을 폈어. 다시 접히면 벽으로 와."
msgstr "它把身子撐到天花板了。要是又折起來，就會回到牆上。"

#. Key:	NightFourWall2b
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(315)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(315)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightFourWall2b"
msgid "구석에 철골 틀이 있었어."
msgstr "角落有個鋼架。"

#. Key:	NightFourWall2bUnseen
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(316)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(316)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightFourWall2bUnseen"
msgid "저 마디를 걸어 둘 만한 게 이 층에 없을까. 둘러보자."
msgstr "這層樓有沒有東西能卡住那個關節？四處找找看。"

#. Key:	NightFourWall2c
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(317)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(317)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightFourWall2c"
msgid "철골 틀을 세워서 저 무릎 마디를 걸어 두자."
msgstr "把鋼架立起來，卡住那個膝關節。"

#. Key:	NightFourWall3a
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(321)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(321)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightFourWall3a"
msgid "틀이 밀렸어."
msgstr "鋼架被推歪了。"

#. Key:	NightFourWall3b
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(322)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(322)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightFourWall3b"
msgid "저게 버티면서 틀을 밀고 있어."
msgstr "那東西硬撐著，一直在推鋼架。"

#. Key:	NightFourWall3c
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(323)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(323)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightFourWall3c"
msgid "밀린 틀을 다시 세우자."
msgstr "把推歪的鋼架扶正。"

#. Key:	NightFourWall3Ia
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(325)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(325)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightFourWall3Ia"
msgid "덧판은 떼어 냈어. 안쪽 판이 남았어."
msgstr "補板拆掉了。還剩裡層的板子。"

#. Key:	NightFourWall3Ib
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(326)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(326)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightFourWall3Ib"
msgid "안쪽 판은 기둥을 따라 나사로 박았어."
msgstr "裡層的板子沿著柱子鎖了螺絲。"

#. Key:	NightFourWall3Ic
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(327)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(327)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightFourWall3Ic"
msgid "양쪽 기둥 자리의 나사를 쳐 내자."
msgstr "把兩邊柱子那裡的螺絲敲掉。"

#. Key:	NightFourWall4a
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(330)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(330)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightFourWall4a"
msgid "거의 다 됐어."
msgstr "就快好了。"

#. Key:	NightFourWall4b
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(331)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(331)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightFourWall4b"
msgid "위에 철물 하나가 남았어."
msgstr "上面還剩一個鐵件。"

#. Key:	NightFourWall4c
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(332)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(332)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightFourWall4c"
msgid "위쪽 가운데 ㄱ자 철물을 쳐 내자."
msgstr "把上面中間那個L型鐵件敲掉。"

#. Key:	NightFourWall1
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(338)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(338)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightFourWall1"
msgid "물소리가 나는 동안 벽을 쳐야 해."
msgstr "得趁有水聲的時候砸牆。"

#. Key:	NightFourWall2
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(339)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(339)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightFourWall2"
msgid "낮에 사 온 망치가 있잖아. 5층 벽 앞으로 가자."
msgstr "不是有白天買的鐵鎚嗎？去五樓的牆前面吧。"

#. Key:	NightFourWall3
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(340)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(340)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightFourWall3"
msgid "물소리가 날 때 5층 가운데 벽을 망치로 치자. 구멍이 날 때까지."
msgstr "趁有水聲的時候，拿鐵鎚敲五樓中間那面牆，一直敲到破洞為止。"

#. Key:	NightFourReveal1
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(345)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(345)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightFourReveal1"
msgid "벽 안을 봐야 해."
msgstr "得看看牆裡面。"

#. Key:	NightFourReveal2
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(346)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(346)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightFourReveal2"
msgid "손전등으로 벽 안쪽을 비춰 보자."
msgstr "用手電筒照一下牆裡面。"

#. Key:	NightFourChoice1
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(349)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(349)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightFourChoice1"
msgid "오빠 곁에 가 보자."
msgstr "去哥身邊吧。"

#. Key:	NightFourChoice2
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(350)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(350)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightFourChoice2"
msgid "튜닝 해머를 돌려놓고 갈까. 아니면 녹음을 끄고 조금 더 있을까."
msgstr "要把調音扳手還給他，然後離開嗎？還是關掉錄音，再陪他一下？"

