#. Key:	A11yHintsDesc
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Player/IGHorrorHUD.cpp(5661)
#: Source/IndieGame/Player/IGHorrorHUD.cpp(5661)
msgctxt "IGHUD,A11yHintsDesc"
msgid "힌트 키를 누르면 다음에 살펴볼 곳을 알려 줍니다. 다시 누르면 더 자세한 힌트가 나옵니다."
msgstr "按提示鍵會告訴你接下來該看哪裡。再按一次，提示會更詳細。"

#. Key:	A11yReducedMotionDesc
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Player/IGHorrorHUD.cpp(5662)
#: Source/IndieGame/Player/IGHorrorHUD.cpp(5662)
msgctxt "IGHUD,A11yReducedMotionDesc"
msgid "걷거나 쫓길 때 화면이 덜 흔들리게 합니다."
msgstr "減少走路或被追趕時的畫面晃動。"

#. Key:	A11yReducedFlickerDesc
