#. Key:	A11yHoldInputDesc
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Player/IGHorrorHUD.cpp(5679)
#: Source/IndieGame/Player/IGHorrorHUD.cpp(5679)
msgctxt "IGHUD,A11yHoldInputDesc"
