msgstr "如果長按按鍵有困難，可以改成按一下開始、再按一下取消。"

#. Key:	A11yHoldDurationDesc
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Player/IGHorrorHUD.cpp(5680)
#: Source/IndieGame/Player/IGHorrorHUD.cpp(5680)
